        {
          "type": "text",
          "id": "bGhNL",
          "name": "desc",
          "fill": "$text-2",
          "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
          "width": 700,
          "content": "The update runs in a real PTY inside the modal, so the CLI's progress and prompts show exactly as in a terminal and are answered there. While it runs the modal has no button and cannot be closed (no Esc, no scrim click): stopping npm or brew halfway can leave a broken install. When the process exits, the footer says what happened and one button closes the modal; the row re-reads the version.",
          "lineHeight": 1.5,
          "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
          "fontSize": 12,
          "fontWeight": "normal"
        },
